        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli v'ose v'ayu'mbaga ku'fuma ku' lwandi' lwa Elimu, v'ayaga na ku'fika ku' ibalangu' lya Sini, i'lo lyav'age li'li' hagati' ya Elimu na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo lwav'age lwa iku'mi na itano lwa mwezi gwa wu'v'i'li' ku'fuma ku'wu'ka ku' nsi' ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene V'aizilaeli v'ose aho v'av'age kwenu'ko ku' ibalangu', v'av'isayi'li'li'laga Mose na Aloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'aizilaeli v'ayombaga ati', “Ndi' yi'li' visoga Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'wu'lagi'le ku' nsi' ya Misili, u'ko kwav'age kwikalile na ku'lya nyama haki'mo na migate zya kwiku'tya. Ali'vi inywe mwaku'letile ku'no ku' ibalangu', ki'gele muku'wu'lage iv'ilingano lyose lyeni'li' ku' nzala!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Lingaga, ene nku'v'iti'la migate ku'fuma ku' ilunde ki'ti' matonye ga nvula. Ki'la lu'siku' v'antu' v'aku'v'a v'ali'fuma ha ibala na ku'solela viliwa vya ku'v'agelani'la ku' lu'siku' lu'mo. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' nku'v'agema mbone u'lu' v'aku'londa nzi'la yanne ninga ng'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa mu lu'siku' lwa mukaga, aho v'alav'e v'ali'wiv'anga ki'liwa cha ku'leta mugati', chene v'alasolele kali' kav'i'li' yakwe, ku'ki'la i'cho v'ali'solelaga nsiku' zingi'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose na Aloni v'av'awi'laga V'aizilaeli v'ose ati', “Mpi'ndi' muku'manya ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu hu' mwene wamufumizye ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Misili! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ndiyu' mulalu'wone lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno wigagwa misayo zinywe ku' wakwe. Iswe ku'li' v'a nde mpaka mukwisayi'li'li'le?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wayombaga ati', “Mpi'ndi' Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'v'a ali'mupa nyama muli'lya, na ndiyu' aku'v'a ali'mupa migate, muv'e muli'lya na kwiku'ta, ku'nguno wigagwa misayo zinywe zyose ku' wakwe. Iswe ku'li' v'a nde? Ng'o, mwisayi'li'laga ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wamuwi'laga Aloni ati', “Li'wi'le iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli v'ose ati', ‘Mwikuminge ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno wigagwa misayo zinywe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga itungo i'lo Aloni wav'aga ali'yomba na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli, v'ose v'alingaga ku' lwandi' lwa ibalangu', kasinaga lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lwigelaga mu ilunde! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nigagwa misayo zya V'aizilaeli. Hohene u'v'awi'le ati', ‘Mpi'ndi' muku'v'a muli'lya nyama, na ndiyu' muku'v'a muli'lya migate na kwiku'ta. Haho muku'manya ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga mu lyu'v'a lya mpi'ndi', zizaga nkwale nyingi na ku'yi'kumba nkambi' ya V'aizilaeli, na ndiyu' yayo lwagwaga lu'me ki'la lwandi' ku'yi'pilima nkambi' yav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga lu'me lwenu'lo aho lwamalaga, kasinaga gigelaga mav'ale mado mado ki'ti' mugate mulelemazu ha nsi' yeni'yo ya ibalangu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o V'aizilaeli aho v'awonaga vintu' vyeni'vyo v'akumyaga na kwiwu'zya, “Ki' cheni'chi'?” Nguno v'av'age v'akamanya ku'v'a ki'li' ki'ntu' ki'. Haho Mose wav'awi'laga ati', “Gwenu'gu' gu'li' mugate u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu wamupaga mulye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhayo gwenu'gu' hu' u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye: ‘Ki'la muntu' akuminge ki'liwa i'cho akowolile ku'lya, asolele muteko gu'mo ku' ki'la muntu' ku'londana na v'antu' av'o ali' nav'o mu ihema lyakwe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, V'aizilaeli v'av'ezya vyeni'vyo, ali'vi mugati' nav'o v'amo ndi' v'asolela vingi na v'angi' vidoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o aho v'avipimaga i'vyo v'asolelaga mu muteko, ndi' v'awona ku'v'a u'yo ndi' wasolelaga vingi, ndi' akav'ile na cha ku'sigali'la, na u'yo ndi' wasolelaga ki'doo ndi' akadohelilwe. Ki'la yu'mo wasolelaga ki'ti' i'vyo ki'mugelani'lile ku'lya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wav'awi'laga ati', “Muntu' ninga yu'mo ku'du' alekele ki'liwa cheni'chi' mpaka ndiyu'.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi v'antu' ndi' v'akamudegelekile Mose. Mugati' nav'o v'amo v'itu'u'li'zyaga ki'liwa mpaka ndiyu'. Ali'vi ki'liwa cheni'cho i'cho ndi' v'itu'u'li'zyaga ku'fiki'la ndiyu' ndi' chasangwa chagasaga na ku'v'a na magunyo. Haho Mose wav'adaki'laga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, ki'la ndiyu' v'av'age v'ali'solela ki'liwa, ki'la yu'mo ku'londana na ki'lyi'le chakwe, na yav'age mbe lyu'v'a lyaliina, i'cho ki'liwa ki'ngi' ndi' chayelage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
