          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa mu lu'siku' lwa mukaga v'akumingage kali' kav'i'li' yakwe, ki'la yu'mo miteko iv'i'li'. Hangi' v'anamala v'a Izilaeli v'ayaga ku'mwa Mose na ku'muwi'la igambo lyeni'lo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wav'awi'laga ati', “Yeni'yi' hu' nhama yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu: Igolo lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ku'lenda, u'lo hu' Sabato nsondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ku'nguno yeni'yo yagi mukakomele i'vyo muli'koov'a na mukasev'ye i'vyo muli'koov'a walelo, na viliwa i'vyo viku'sigali'la muvitu'u'le mpaka igolo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, v'avitu'u'laga viliwa vingi', ki'ti' i'vyo Mose wakalagi'li'zyaga. Wangalu'ke yayo ndiyu', v'aviwonaga vipanga. Vikagasile ninga ku'v'a na magunyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wav'awi'laga ati', “Lyagi viliwa vyeni'vyo i'vyo vyakasigali'laga, ku'nguno walelo lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Walelo mukapandi'ke viliwa vyeni'vyo ha ibala na nkambi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mukaga mulav'e muli'solela viliwa, sumbwa lu'siku' lwa mupungati' lu'li' lwa ki'suuho. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo vikasye vigele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninga vyeni'vyo mugati' na v'antu' v'enav'o, v'angi' ndi' v'aya ku'kasolela, ali'vi v'akaviwine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Muku'kaana ku'ziku'zya nhama zyanne na nzi'la zyanne mpaka nanali'? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumanye ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu wamupile inywe lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, ku'nguno yeni'yo mu lu'siku' lwa mukaga ali'mupa ki'liwa cha nsiku' iv'i'li'. Ki'la yu'mo yi'li'mudima ku'suuha mu nnumba yakwe lu'siku' lwa mupungati'. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo yi'kakoov'iwa ku'fuma ha ibala, ninga yu'mo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene v'antu' v'enav'o v'asuuhaga lu'siku' lwa mupungati'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
