            "sid": "EXO 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene ha itungo lya mbele Aloni ndi' wayi'tu'u'la mana ha mbele ya isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa ki'gele yi'su'ngwe, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wafumizye ilagi'li'zyo ku'mwa Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o V'aizilaeli v'alyaga mana yeni'yo ku' itungo lya myaka maku'mi ane, mpaka aho v'afikaga ha lwandi' u'lo ndi' lu'li' na v'antu', yaani v'alyaga mpaka aho v'afikaga ku' lu'v'i'mbi' lwa Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muteko gu'mo gu'gelani'lile na kilo yi'mo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:36",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "“Kilo yi'mo” ku' Ki'ebulania yi'li' lwandi' lwa iku'mi lwa efa. “Muteko” gu'li' ki'pimo cha wokale ku' Ki'ebulania “Omeli” u'go gu'gelani'lile na lita iv'i'li'.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
